message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the following."
title: "Blood DNA methylation traces an epigenetic trajectory across stages of dementia"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and manuscript sources for an epigenome-wide association study
  of blood DNA methylation and dementia progression in the AGES-Reykjavik
  cohort (n = 2,491).
type: software
license: MIT
